337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_2,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,12,337X393,null,"A planned 7F rotor out major inspection with Advanced Gas Path (AGP) and Dry Low NOX 2.6+ (DLN2.6+) upgrades and generator MAGIC started on April 4th, 2022 at NV Energy's Frank Tracy Generating Station. Project was executed using Atlantic Plant Maintenance (APM) millwrights and APM Specialty Services Technicians, all under supervision of the onsite FieldCore Technical Field Advisors (TFA). Baker Hughes (BH) was contracted to perform a controls system upgrade (Mark VI to Mark VIe), an exciter upgrade (EX2100 to EX2100e), and an LCI upgrade (LS2100 to LS2100e). GT8 serial number is 298613 while the accompanying 7FH2 generator serial number is 337X393. FMI# F7131G22 was incorporated which included AGP, DLN2.6+, High Output R0's and S0's, and newly designed S5 stator vanes specifically for units running evap coolers. The schedule included working a single 12-hour shift for disassembly and a single 10-hour shift for the remainder of the outage. Crews signed off LOTOs ahead of schedule on May 7th. Major work completed (for details, see section report): • Auxiliary Section • Replaced PM3 gas control valve (GCV) per the FMI. All GCV's were calibrated by onsite FieldCore controls TFA prior to start up. • Installed new Safety Shut-Off Valve (SSOV) on the main fuel gas line just outside the fuel gas skid per the FMI. • Installed new Safety Shut-Off Vent Valve (SSOVV) and vent line downstream of the SSOV per the FMI. • Installed five new hazardous gas detection panels per the FMI. i. Three panels were added on the fuel gas skid which detect methane. ii. Two panels were added on the generator left side which detect hydrogen. • Combustion Section • The following components were removed, visually inspected, and replaced with new DLN2.6+ components: i. Fuel Nozzles ii. Forward Combustion Cans iii. Aft Combustion Cans iv. Combustion Liners v. Inner Crossfire Tubes vi. Outer Crossfire Tubes vii. Flow Sleeves viii. Transition Pieces (TPs) ix. Spark Plug Assemblies x. CDM Probes xi. Flame detector sight tube mount • Compressor Section • Compressor case was disassembled, cleaned, and inspected. • Cleaned and visually inspected Inlet Guide Vanes (IGVs). IGVs were calibrated using the package 4 angle limits prior to start up. • Rotor blades and stator vanes were cleaned, mapped for defects, and blend repaired as needed. • Completed front end compressor TILs. • As per the FMI, S0s and R0s were replaced with High Output variants. Stage 5 stator vanes were replaced with newly designed segments for units running evap coolers. • Three of the older style shrouded stage 17 segments were removed, visually inspected, and reinstalled. • Recorded opening and closing compressor clearances. • Turbine Section • Removed, visually inspected, and replaced the following components with AGP hardware: i. Stage 1, 2, and 3 buckets ii. Stage 1, 2, and 3 nozzles iii. Stage 1, 2, and 3 shrouds • Recorded opening and closing clearances. • Replaced all turbine manway and access covers per the FMI. • Fit up and field welded upper half right side Inlet Bleed Heat (IBH) pipe. • Polished high metal on minor wheelspace rub. • Exhaust Section • Removed upper half exhaust case, visually inspected, cleaned and reinstalled. • Replaced flex seals with upgraded components. • Rotor • Removed, cleaned, and performed applicable inspection TILs on the front end compressor and turbine rotor. • Bearings • Turbine i. Removed, performed NDE inspections, and replaced T1, T2, and thrust bearings. ii. Replaced all stationary oil seals except the air deflector (1S6). iii. Replaced T1 and T2 lift hoses. • Generator i. Removed, performed NDE inspections, and replaced T3 and T4 bearing. ii. Replaced both lift hoses. iii. Replaced inner and outer oil deflectors except for collector end outer oil deflector. • Generator • Performed MAGIC and electrical tests. Please see Casey Cardwell's section in this report. • Replaced all hydrogen seals",2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,"[0.022644976153969765,0.012542876414954662,-0.005199361126869917,-0.023746715858578682,-0.031069044023752213,0.01839056797325611,-0.04457806050777435,0.04773072898387909,0.0033009799662977457,0.05786672979593277,0.04115419462323189,-0.026221390813589096,0.011602160520851612,0.01621251553297043,-0.023238221183419228,0.05095119774341583,-0.07546065747737885,-0.0012606438249349594,-0.0001894938322948292,-0.03449290990829468,0.01313612051308155,0.0173481535166502,0.012627624906599522,0.022763624787330627,0.014364982955157757,0.005512933246791363,0.0068646823056042194,0.022068681195378304,0.029306260868906975,-0.018407518044114113,-0.01959400624036789,0.042815275490283966,-0.011602160520851612,0.021797485649585724,0.025068802759051323,-0.015636220574378967,0.027509577572345734,0.03593364357948303,0.008165582083165646,0.034645456820726395,-0.030441898852586746,-0.038408320397138596,-0.017390528693795204,0.04362886771559715,0.04681543633341789,-0.008093545213341713,-0.020678795874118805,-0.031001243740320206,-0.01996690221130848,0.03395051509141922,-0.011958107352256775,-0.001914271735586226,-0.018492266535758972,0.03135719150304794,0.034289512783288956,-0.0052841100841760635,0.004864601884037256,0.15065011382102966,-0.0034386971965432167,-0.004182371310889721,0.015483671799302101,-0.009864802472293377,-0.021136440336704254,0.019763505086302757,-0.010076675564050674,-0.0016504899831488729,-0.014542956836521626,0.011390287429094315,-0.011508936062455177,0.010178374126553535,-0.03773032873868942,-0.02989950403571129,-0.00511461216956377,0.031272441148757935,0.007669799029827118,-0.005644294433295727,0.05383266881108284,0.005809555295854807,-0.008195243775844574,-0.007902859710156918,0.015017551369965076,0.05410386621952057,-0.03200128301978111,0.04078129678964615,0.001166360336355865,0.03817102313041687,-0.05766332894563675,-0.0994616150856018,-0.019763505086302757,0.022644976153969765,0.005084950011223555,0.009220