337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_3,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,14,337X393,null,". • Generator • Performed MAGIC and electrical tests. Please see Casey Cardwell's section in this report. • Replaced all hydrogen seals. • Shipped TE H2 casing for surface machining to remove joint step and surface pitting. • Replaced turning gear clutch seals. • Replaced both o-rings on the field bore plug. • Completed generator and turning gear alignment. • Machined new sets of GIB keys as part of generator alignment. • Replaced TE GIB key expansion joint. • Replaced full set of collector fan blades. • Removed two hydrogen coolers, cleaned oil from the stator, and reinstalled. • Control System • Completed a Full Migration Mark VI Control System to a Mark VIe Control System. • Installed a Mark VIe Auxiliary Panel (AUX Panel) to power up and control the new CDM System as well as the new Hazardous Gas Panels. • Completed a Full Migration Ex2100 to Ex2100e Exciter Control System. • Completed a Full Migration LS2100 to LS2100e LCI Control System. • Downloaded new software for DLN2.6+ Combustion Modes. • Downloaded new HMI Graphics and tested them all for functionality. • Upgraded all the HMI Workstation to High-Availability Servers and Thinclient. • Calibrated all Gas Control Valves within 0.1% tolerance. • Calibrated the IGV Valve within 0.5 deg tolerance. • Calibrated all new Hazardous Gas Sensors. • Shot all electrical loops related to new field devices (such as Spark Plugs, CDM, Haz Gas, Flame Detectors, Fans Pressure Switches) and/or to existing equipment that were de-terminated for the purpose of the outage (such as all motors, valves, and pressure transmitters). Generator Specialist Work Summary: GT8 Generator (SN 337X393) outage ran from 04-07-2022 to 04-17-2022. Generator Collector-End (CE) and Turbine-End (TE) upper end-shields and all gas-shields were removed for High Voltage testing, MAGIC inspection, and repairs. The inboard Collector studs’ hydrogen seal assembly was replaced after pressure testing indicated a faulty seal. Field Inspection – by MAGIC: • Outboard collector stud hydrogen seal passed the 30-minute 80psi nitrogen pressure test; however, Inboard collector stud hydrogen seal didn’t pass this pressure test. • Installed new hydrogen seal assembly on a new inboard collector stud and passed the 30-minute 80psi nitrogen pressure tests, please see attached photos. • Brush surfaces were in acceptable condition. • Visual inspection revealed acceptable physical condition of Retaining rings at Collector- End (CE) and Turbine-End (TE) exterior surface. • Fan blades for the collector-end appeared in acceptable physical condition. • Bore-scope visual inspection of CE end-winding indicated acceptable physical conditions and cleanliness of winding components such as: main-leads’ leaves goose- necks brazed joints, intact gooseneck supporting hardware, coil-to-coil jumpers, pole-to- pole jumpers, sub-slot cooling channels, and end-winding blockings. • No visible end-turn copper distortion or migration. • No visible Turn-to-Turn insulation migration at Collector-End (CE) and Turbine-End (TE). • Hydrogen seals, please see mechanical report for detail. • As-Found and Post-Repair electrical tests on Field winding were performed in this outage. Stator Inspection - by MAGIC and Visual: • Oil can be seen underneath the stator winding and through out the generator. • Greasing wedges can be seen in multiple locations through out the stator core. • Connection rings showed greasing ties in one location that was inaccessible for repair. • Inspection found all but one location on the axial support hardware in acceptable physical condition however none was secured with epoxy; to satisfied TIL 1398. • End-wedges greasing can be seen in several locations at both Turbine-End (TE) and Collector-End (CE). • Foreign material still present in stator ventilation slots from a white rag discovered in 2015 and documented in previous report. • All six High Voltage Bushings (HVB) were in acceptable physical conditions",2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,"[0.02976127341389656,-0.004913418088108301,-0.009834857657551765,-0.011334954760968685,-0.02886282093822956,0.030258633196353912,-0.03661198168992996,0.03401288390159607,0.012353736907243729,0.0500887855887413,0.05329754948616028,-0.008880251087248325,0.021947937086224556,0.03280960023403168,-0.021723324432969093,0.06433569639921188,-0.03949986770749092,-0.016605347394943237,-0.015827221795916557,-0.02664877474308014,-0.006914883852005005,0.007231749128550291,0.017904896289110184,0.022028155624866486,0.01269867829978466,-0.008671681396663189,-0.003006209619343281,0.015634696930646896,0.032745424658060074,-0.003756257938221097,-0.01795302703976631,0.02204420045018196,-0.015674805268645287,0.015482280403375626,0.03362783417105675,-0.012586371973156929,0.015361951664090157,0.01947719044983387,0.010725289583206177,-0.000513402046635747,-0.030483245849609375,-0.030290720984339714,-0.005968298763036728,0.03494342789053917,0.032745424658060074,-0.003976860083639622,-0.01232967060059309,-0.03786339983344078,-0.019653672352433205,0.02948853000998497,-0.033050257712602615,-0.02555779553949833,-0.015361951664090157,0.044120486825704575,0.021835630759596825,-0.0291034784168005,0.018707087263464928,0.14349587261676788,0.009842880070209503,-0.01429503783583641,0.023520231246948242,0.005330557003617287,-0.01808137819170952,0.010348259471356869,-0.005647422280162573,0.007777238730341196,-0.0008132208022288978,-0.007291913498193026,-0.02563801407814026,0.0007309962529689074,-0.028654251247644424,-0.03109291009604931,-0.029793361201882362,0.035938143730163574,-0.0014750281115993857,-0.00831871759146452,0.06109484285116196,0.01332438737154007,0.005061823409050703,-0.016813917085528374,0.02072860673069954,0.05949046090245247,-0.0500887855887413,0.020696518942713737,-0.004933472722768784,-0.00353966630063951,-0.06346932798624039,-0.09356752038002014,-0.00441204896196723,0.0010799492010846734,0