337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_8,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,20,337X393,null,"Part Condition: Good Part Description: PM3 fuel gas control valve was replaced with new as part of the FMI. All GCV's were calibrated by the on site controls TA before start up. A new Safety Shut-Off Valve and Safety Shut-Off Vent Valve were installed per the FMI. Previous designs called for the SSOVV piping to be routed along the ground. Due to an elevated main fuel gas line, the vent pipe was supported along the acoustic barrier wall by the exhaust support I-beams and gussets. Aztech performed SSOV X-ray inspections and visually inspected all vent piping welds. P2 cavity vent valve and associated vent tubing was increased and replaced with 3/4"" diameter hardware per TIL 2042. Recommendation Status: Should be planned for next Outage Recommendation Type: Services Recommendation Description: Calibrate all GCV's during the next planned inspection. New PM3 New SSOV New SSOVV SSOV Vent Line SSOV Vent Line (1) P2 Cavity Vent Valve Aztech GT8 Aztech GT8 Aztech GT8 Aztech GT8 SSOV X-Rays",2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,"[0.013494457118213177,0.039369624108076096,-0.006350078620016575,0.018458828330039978,0.0044420333579182625,0.023103753104805946,-0.040060319006443024,0.024036191403865814,-0.01878690905869007,0.03916241601109505,0.02515857107937336,-0.0030390587635338306,-0.009384820237755775,0.008404896594583988,-0.023742645978927612,0.03805730491876602,-0.048763077706098557,0.009471157565712929,-0.03546719625592232,-0.039576832205057144,0.001500103622674942,0.006246474571526051,0.0039909230545163155,0.019874753430485725,0.011577777564525604,-0.007317051757127047,0.013762101531028748,0.009989178739488125,0.009004938416182995,0.01702563650906086,0.024295203387737274,0.02515857107937336,-0.0051672630943357944,0.029216405004262924,0.005560095887631178,0.012259839102625847,0.002103382721543312,0.03733207285404205,0.008473966270685196,0.00443339953199029,-0.024536946788430214,-0.034724