337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_10,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,30,337X393,null,"Part Condition: Good Part Description: All fuel gas piping was removed and replaced with clamp-style connection piping as part of the FMI. Interconnect fuel gas piping was hydrotested at 650 psi by Ryan Mechanical. Fuel gas strainers were installed prior to start up for the scheduled strainer run. Strainers were removed on 5/17/2022 and unit was turned over to the customer. Recommendation Status: Should be planned for next Outage Recommendation Type: Parts Recommendation Description: Inspect flex hoses during the next outage. Since all bolted flanges have been replaced with clamp connections, it is recommended to have spare clamp assemblies and seals. Quantities listed below are for a full set. 962 Fuel Gas Piping • PM1 • CLAMP - 372A1913P004, 28 Total • SEAL - 372A1912P103, 28 Total • PM2 • CLAMP - 372A1913P004, 28 Total • SEAL - 372A1912P104, 28 Total • PM3 • CLAMP - 372A1913P005, 28 Total • SEAL - 372A1912P005, 28 Total • Pilot • CLAMP - 372A1913P002, 28 Total • SEAL - 372A1912P102, 28 Total New Fuel Gas Pigtails Fuel Gas Manifold New Fuel Gas Pigtails Interconnect Piping Hydrotest Interconnect Piping Hydrotest GT8 Hydrotest PM3 Interconnect Pipi… GT8&9 Hydrotest Interconnect Piping GT8&9 PM3 Interconnect Hydrotest",2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,"[-0.005713073071092367,0.021366233006119728,-0.008660424500703812,0.010864745825529099,-0.01053451094776392,0.018724350258708,-0.040024533867836,0.015124782919883728,0.0006372511852532625,0.016941078007221222,0.03257772698998451,0.02719488926231861,0.030067937448620796,0.004536609165370464,-0.051681846380233765,0.022026704624295235,-0.03384913131594658,0.0009458149434067309,-0.03236307203769684,-0.03490588441491127,0.01498443353921175,0.02068925090134144,0.011046375147998333,-0.014967921189963818,0.001109384698793292,-0.00019736727699637413,-0.010650092735886574,-0.012821391224861145,0.004767774138599634,0.01686677522957325,0.01