337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_16,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,43,337X393,null,"Part Condition: Fair Part Description: The turbine compartment trolley was removed, visually inspected, cleaned, and reinstalled. The chain wheel holder was found broken and failed to keep the chain on the wheel track. A new chain wheel was ordered from J.C. MacElroy and installed. Trolley was inspected prior to use. Recommendation Status: Should be planned for next Outage Recommendation Type: Services Recommendation Description: Inspect chain wheel and trolley prior to use. Created Date: 4/20/2022 8:21:39 AM -07:00 60 - Reno 1315 Greg St. Suite 114 Sparks Nevada 89431 Service Job # 165948 Job Report Fill this form out with summary information about your job Customer NV Energy Clark Job Site Tracy power plant After Hours Work ␀ NO Type of service ␀ Inspection Asset 1 G turbine compressor end bridge - URSG Work Summary Inspect (2) gas turbine bridges Parts Used (2) Foil Inspection Stickers MISC. INSPECTION MATERIALS Hours on Job 4/20/22 - Jason Thomas - 2.5 hrs Mileage 28 total miles to and from inspection site Equipment Used None Additional Notes Customer will install new chain wheel guide on crane 165948-1 Additional Photos See appendix for photos 13.A, 13.B, 13.C, 13.D, 13.E Signatures Customer Name Cathie Fox Technician Name Jason Thomas Signatures Customer Signature Tech Signature Appendix (Additional Photos) Created By: Jason Thomas Powered By Redlist (844-Redlist) 1 of 2 GT8 Trolley NV Energy (Tracy Station… (13.A) Additional Photos (13.B) Additional Photos (13.C) Additional Photos (13.D) Additional Photos (13.E) Additional Photos Created By: Jason Thomas Powered By Redlist (844-Redlist) 2 of 2 GT8 Trolley NV Energy (Tracy Station… Created Date: 4/20/2022 1:11:22 PM -07:00 60 - Reno 1315 Greg St. Suite 114 Sparks Nevada 89431 Service Job # 165948 Overhead Crane Inspection 2.0 For Overhead Crane Inspection Details Customer NV Energy Clark Asset ID Compressor bridge - URSG/MANUAL Crane Des