337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_52,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,151,337X393,null,"Part Condition: Good Part Description: The upper exhaust frame was removed, visually inspected, and reinstalled. Overall, the exhaust frame was in good shape with typical minor cracking found on the diffuser skin. Customer chose not to have cracks repaired given how minor the cracks were. The flex seals had heavy damage upon disassembly with some areas missing the seals completely. A new set of upgraded Gen 2 flex seals were installed and welded. Recommendation Status: Should be planned for next Outage Recommendation Type: Services Recommendation Description: Inspect exhaust frame and flex seals at next scheduled outage. It is recommended to have a spare set of exhaust flex seals for future outages. Upper Half Exhaust Case - AFT End Upper Half Exhaust Case - FWD End Exhaust Cracks Exhaust Cracks Removed Flex Seals New Gen 2 Flex Seals New Gen 2 Flex Seals",2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,"[-0.001072995481081307,0.029224790632724762,-0.011770186945796013,0.010787289589643478,0.011778376996517181,0.0023036638740450144,-0.03708796575665474,0.018331021070480347,-0.011434363201260567,0.018576744943857193,-0.004652377218008041,0.035285986959934235,0.014006276614964008,0.00824814010411501,-0.011835712939500809,0.02037872187793255,-0.04531153291463852,-0.010443275794386864,-0.0069580888375639915,-0.04383718594908714,-0.020247669890522957,0.019969182088971138,0.004085164051502943,0.00443122535943985,-0.04380442574620247,-0.0009337517549283803,0.010926533490419388,-0.012335351668298244,0.007027710322290659,0.014841738156974316,0.007789455354213715,0.021443527191877365,-0.027029655873775482,0.016971347853541374,0.05029154196381569,-0.012450023554265499,0.041216131299734116,0.0024470030330121517,0.027324525639414787,0.011852094903588295,-0.02329464815557003,-0.04042981192469597,-0.04957075044512749,0.02357313595712185,0.030912097543478012,-0.024179255589842796,-0.020902933552861214,0.01