337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_92,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,301,337X393,null,"Part Condition: Fair Part Description: Only 2 of the Third Stage Wheel Space Thermocouples have been replaced during this outage. The existing Thermocouples TT-WS3FO-1,2 Part Number P335 have been replaced with same kind Part Number P335. Note that the Third Stage Wheel Space Thermocouple P193 were not replaced. Recommendation Type: Parts Recommendation Description: Monitor the conditions of the Wheel Space Thermocouples and replace as required. 4.4 Compressor Discharge Thermocouples Part Condition: Fair Part Description: The compressor discharge thermocouples were all replaced during this outage. Recommendation Type: Parts Recommendation Description: Monitor the thermocouples during hours of operation and replace and as required. 4.5 Flame Scanners Part Condition: Good Part Description: The 4 flame detectors were installed back on the Turbine after outage completion and tested accordingly to make sure wires were not crossed. One of the Flame Scanner Cable was damaged and customer took the lead to replace it. It is recommended to monitor the intensity of the flame via the sensor and replace at next outage if necessary. 4.6 Igniters Part Condition: Fair Part Description: As per the upgrade, the Igniters were replaced with new model 362A395P003. They were tested with a LED light and installed as per the specifications. 4.7 Combustible Hazardous Gas Detectors Part Description: As per FMI F7131G22, several HoneyWell Haz Gas Detectors were installed: • Qty 1 Hydrogen Aspirated Haz Gas Detector Panel for the Collector Cab • Qty 1 Hydrogen Aspirated Haz Gas Detector Panel for the Generator Terminal Enclosure • Qty 1 Methane Aspirated Haz Gas Detector Panel for the Gas Compartment • Qty 2 Methane Aspirated Haz Gas Detector Panel for the Gas Turbine Compartment The Haz Gas Detectors Panels are powered by 24 VDC source from the AUX Panel located in the PEECC. The Analog Inputs signals are also terminated in the AUX Panel. The software has been accordingly configured to process the data. Each Aspirated Haz Gas Panel has 2 redundant Sensors that have been accordingly calibrated with the proper calibration gas. Recommendation Description: Perform yearly calibration as recommended by the manufacturer.",2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,"[0.0017131759086623788,0.012066803872585297,-0.006001584231853485,0.022176828235387802,-0.012289526872336864,0.020283684134483337,-0.05469435825943947,0.008129382506012917,0.00990321021527052,0.03382204845547676,0.022813178598880768,-0.0242131520062685,0.004370935261249542,0.029415320605039597,-0.025024497881531715,0.020060962066054344,-0.030878927558660507,-0.006176580674946308,-0.018501901999115944,-0.013180417940020561,-0.009847530163824558,0.009958891198039055,0.0168951153755188,0.02292454056441784,-0.002841704525053501,-0.01291792280972004,0.01160544902086258,-0.023592708632349968,0.015988316386938095,0.02381543256342411,0.0016535180620849133,0.02099957875907421,-0.02351316437125206,0.0026806280948221684,-0.003004769328981638,-0.02243136800825596,0.021047305315732956,0.016751937568187714,0.0303221195936203,0.004398775286972523,-0.0396764762699604,-0.04944446310400963,-0.01651330478489399,0.01730874367058277,0.016195129603147507,-0.016290582716464996,-0.031038014218211174,-0.01633830927312374,-0.004716950934380293,0.010475926101207733,-0.016640575602650642,-0.022988175973296165,-0.05084443464875221,0.04502182453870773,0.05393073707818985,-0.013299733400344849,0.01738828793168068,0.15183332562446594,0.03958102688193321,0.00948162842541933,-0.014294032007455826,0.009680488146841526,-0.06312600523233414,-0.011287273839116096,-0.01341109536588192,-0.013419048860669136,-0.004720928147435188,-0.013403140939772129,-0.008352105505764484,-0.01083387341350317,-0.02935168519616127,-0.031435735523700714,-0.032215263694524765,0.009242996573448181,-0.002068140311166644,0.0008302390342578292,0.06303055584430695,0.0399310179054737