337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic_93,337X393 2022-04-04 Robotic,303,337X393,null,"Part Condition: Good Part Description: Each of the Turbine Fans 88BT were mounted on a new duct where the Methane Haz Gas Detectors sample lines tie in. The power cables for the Fans Motors had to be re-sized to compensate for the new elevation of the Motors vis a vis the Junction box. Three redundant pressure switches per Fan were also install on the Turbine roof next to the fan for Mark VIe redundancy. After installation, both 88BT Turbine Fans were bumped for rotation and each pressure switch was also tested and calibrated.",2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,2026-04-13T02:36:43.024Z,"[0.0055092149414122105,-0.009117590263485909,-0.013056195341050625,0.012750128284096718,-0.009270623326301575,0.001937085180543363,-0.055156584829092026,0.016753168776631355,0.0031573278829455376,0.009061208926141262,0.017993547022342682,-0.04410593956708908,-0.0028371652588248253,-0.0004908154951408505,-0.01532753836363554,0.036309272050857544,-0.011413096450269222,0.026531219482421875,0.022342927753925323,-0.0007072776788845658,0.023357782512903214,0.021344181150197983,0.0029016004409641027,0.023696068674325943,-0.05151599273085594,-0.02359941601753235,-0.009729725308716297,-0.018589572980999947,0.015053688548505306,-0.041882921010255814,0.014457662589848042,0.057186298072338104,-0.008843740448355675,0.012017176486551762,0.0010153588373214006,0.014973144978284836,0.03804902359843254,0.019588319584727287,-0.021473051980137825,-0.018815096467733383,-0.046554479748010635,-0.016930365934967995,-0.02595130354166031,0.013032032176852226,0.009705561213195324,0.008779305033385754,-0.024517618119716644,-0.009512255899608135,-0.002494852989912033,0.03315194323658943,0.004651420749723911,0.021102549508213997,-0.05696077272295952,0.06147124245762825,0.022117404267191887,-0.03837120160460472,0.00660864170640707,0.1635366976261139,-0.00046111486153677106,0.0024888119660317898,0.011292279697954655,-0.006528097670525312,-0.019636645